00:00:10,560 --> 00:00:18,630
Two entry orders for the same client and instrument: a buy limit below the market and a buy stop above it.

2
00:00:18,730 --> 00:00:24,990
First show the OCO column.

3
00:00:25,090 --> 00:00:28,510
Link OCO Order makes the two orders One-Cancels-Other.

4
00:00:28,610 --> 00:00:38,480
Pick the order to link with. Only orders that can be linked are listed: same client, instrument and side, one limit and one stop.

5
00:00:38,580 --> 00:00:42,980
Each order now shows its partner in OCO. When one fills, the other is cancelled.

